# Local development — you do NOT need a frontend/.env file.
#
# The only variable the frontend reads is VITE_API_URL, and its default in
# src/lib/axios.js already points at the local backend. Create frontend/.env
# from this file only if you need to override that default.
#
# frontend/.env is gitignored, so it only ever affects your local machine.

# VITE_API_URL — backend base URL. Defaults to http://localhost:5001/api